'''Boulder Stretch Rope''' is a earth-type [[Spells|spell]] that shapes stone into a flexible ribbon.

==Description==
Boulder stretch contains a central earth sigil with a single weave sign wrapped around it. This spell turns stone into a flexible ribbon that can be used for many purposes.

==Usage==
This spell was created and used by Richeh to cross a gap in the road of the [[Serpentback Cave|serpent-back cave]].{{Ref|m|21|4}}

It was also included in the mural of spells that the girls had on hand when discussing a way to save Euini,{{Ref|m|28|11}} and later used by [[Agott]], [[Coco]], and [[Tetia]] to capture [[Euini|Wolf Euini]].{{Ref|m|28|19-20}}

